read x in unsealed header: phi v2, no operands yet
read y in unsealed header: phi v3, no operands yet
seal header: phi v2 for x gets v0 v6
seal header: phi v3 for y gets v1 v3, so it is trivial: v1 replaces it
after the loop: x is v2, y is v1
 entry: v0 = 0
 entry: v1 = 5
header: v2 = phi v0 v6
header: v4 = less v2 v1
  body: v5 = 1
  body: v6 = add v2 v5
